    "paragraph": "This study analyzed the relationship between hospital travel times and mortality in Spain from 2010 to 2019 by combining population and mortality microdata with census-section level car travel times to the five nearest hospitals. Another paper mapped the intellectual architecture of housing discrimination research from 1972 to 2022 by analyzing a curated corpus of 1,350 peer-reviewed publications from Web of Science and Scopus. Finally, a third study analyzed the neoliberal transformation of the Swedish construction sector using a mixed-methods approach grounded in historical materialism.",
